### 3. Additional context (if relevant):                                                                                
The inclusion decisions are strictly based on the presence of a randomised (or quasi‑randomised) design evaluating      
manual therapy (e.g., mobilisations, manipulations, massage) and/or structured exercise programmes for adhesive         
capsulitis (frozen shoulder). Studies lacking randomisation, focusing solely on epidemiology, diagnostics, or           
non‑interventional designs were excluded to preserve the integrity of the systematic review’s eligibility criteria.     
